---
import emojiData from '../../data/emoji/generated.json';
import { kaomoji } from '../../data/kaomoji/index';
import { nextPage } from '../../scripts/characters/pagination';
import CharacterItem from './CharacterItem.astro';
const initialEmoji = nextPage(emojiData.entries, 0, 'emoji');
const initialKaomoji = nextPage(kaomoji, 0, 'kaomoji');
---
<div class="character-browser" data-character-browser>
  <div class="character-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="문자 종류">
    <button type="button" id="emoji-tab" role="tab" data-mode="emoji" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="emoji-panel" tabindex="0" disabled>Unicode 이모지</button>
    <button type="button" id="kaomoji-tab" role="tab" data-mode="kaomoji" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="kaomoji-panel" tabindex="-1" disabled>텍스트 이모티콘</button>
  </div>
  <p class="character-hint">종류를 바꾸면 검색어와 카테고리가 초기화됩니다. ⌄ 표시가 있는 이모지는 변형을 선택한 뒤 복사하고, 나머지 문자는 바로 복사합니다.</p>
  <div class="character-search">
    <label for="character-query">문자 검색</label>
    <div class="character-search__input">
      <input id="character-query" type="search" placeholder="웃음, 하트, 고양이…" autocomplete="off" disabled />
      <button type="button" data-clear disabled>검색어 지우기</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="character-categories" role="group" aria-label="카테고리" data-categories></div>
  <p data-result-count role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">검색 결과 {emojiData.entries.length.toLocaleString('ko-KR')}개 · {initialEmoji.length}개 표시</p>
  <section aria-label="문자 검색 결과">
    <div id="emoji-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="emoji-tab">
      <ul class="character-grid" data-results data-mode-results="emoji" data-initial>
        {initialEmoji.map((entry) => <CharacterItem entry={entry} variants />)}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div id="kaomoji-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="kaomoji-tab" hidden>
      <ul class="character-grid character-grid--text" data-mode-results="kaomoji" data-initial>
        {initialKaomoji.map((entry) => <CharacterItem entry={entry} />)}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p data-empty hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다. 검색어나 카테고리를 바꿔 보세요.</p>
    <button type="button" class="character-more" data-more hidden>더 보기</button>
  </section>
  <p class="character-feedback" data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
  <div class="character-toast" data-copy-toast data-visible="false" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
  <div class="character-fallback" data-fallback hidden>
    <label for="manual-copy">복사하지 못했어요. 아래 문자를 선택해 직접 복사해 주세요.</label>
    <textarea id="manual-copy" readonly rows="2"></textarea>
  </div>
  <dialog class="character-dialog" data-variants aria-labelledby="variant-title">
    <div class="character-dialog__header">
      <h2 id="variant-title">이모지 변형 선택</h2>
      <button type="button" data-close>닫기</button>
    </div>
    <p data-variant-name></p>
    <p>원하는 문자를 누르면 복사됩니다.</p>
    <ul class="character-grid" data-variant-results></ul>
  </dialog>
  <noscript><p>기본 이모지 192개는 JavaScript 없이도 볼 수 있습니다. 탭 전환·검색·변형 선택·복사·더 보기는 JavaScript가 필요합니다. 필요한 문자는 직접 선택해 복사하세요.</p></noscript>
</div>
